---
import { Image, getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AboutIntro from '../components/AboutIntro.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import SubstackFeed from '../components/SubstackFeed.astro';
import NameW from '../assets/about-name-w.svg';
import NameI from '../assets/about-name-i.svg';
import NameL from '../assets/about-name-l.svg';
import NameR from '../assets/about-name-r.svg';
import aboutHero from '../assets/about.webp';
import cw4 from '../assets/cw4.webp';
import cw2 from '../assets/cw2.webp';

// The glitch slices paint cw2 as a CSS background; resolve one optimized URL for them.
// 480 matches a width in the <Image> srcset below, so the browser reuses that file.
const cw2Bg = await getImage({ src: cw2, width: 480 });
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Meet Charles Wilke: writer, designer, and AI tutor. Fellow Vector helps individuals and teams build skills, judgment, and agency through hands-on learning."
>

  <PageHero label="// about the operator" title="Charles Wilke" image={aboutHero} serifTitle>
    <span slot="title" class="about-name" aria-hidden="true">Cha<NameR class="name-letter name-r" />les <span class="about-surname"><NameW class="name-letter name-w" /><NameI class="name-letter name-i" /><NameL class="name-letter name-l" />ke</span></span>
    <p class="page-hero-sub text-muted">Writer. Designer. AI Tutor.</p>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-grid">

      <div class="about-body">

        <AboutIntro placement="above" />

        <!-- Portrait floats right; body text wraps around it -->
        <div class="portrait-wrap portrait-inline">
          <div class="portrait-glitch-container" style={`--cw2-bg: url(${cw2Bg.src})`}>
            <span class="corner tl"></span>
            <span class="corner tr"></span>
            <span class="corner bl"></span>
            <span class="corner br"></span>
            <Image
              src={cw4}
              alt="Charles Wilke"
              class="portrait-img"
              widths={[320, 480, 640]}
              sizes="(max-width: 600px) min(42vw, 196px), 240px"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <Image
              src={cw2}
              alt=""
              class="portrait-reveal"
              aria-hidden="true"
              widths={[320, 480, 640]}
              sizes="(max-width: 600px) min(42vw, 196px), 240px"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <div class="glitch-slice s1"></div>
            <div class="glitch-slice s2"></div>
            <div class="glitch-slice s3"></div>
            <div class="portrait-scanlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <a href="/book" class="btn btn-primary portrait-cta">Book Time with Charles</a>
        </div>

        <AboutIntro placement="beside" />

        <p>
          Before that, I spent years making games at Insomniac and crafting content for product at GoDaddy.
          Roles that taught me how technology earns its place in someone's day.
        </p>

        <p>
          Through Fellow Vector, I help people learn to use AI in the work they actually do.
          I think of myself as a tutor: someone beside you while you try, ask questions,
          get stuck, and figure out what to do next. AI driver's ed, if you like.
        </p>
        <p>
          That might start with one person learning a tool or a team exploring what it
          means for a particular role. It can reach all the way to building a full business
          application. The scale can change; the learning stays part of the work.
        </p>
        <p>
          Capacity building is the point. I want you to understand what you've made,
          decide whether it helps, and feel able to keep going.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm pro-employee. Automation can give people room to do more meaningful work,
          and it can also be used to replace them. That choice matters. My focus is on
          strengthening people's skills and agency, with employees helping shape how
          these tools fit their roles.
        </p>
        <p>
          The terminal glow is an invitation. Apple II, Math Blaster, The Oregon Trail:
          for a lot of us, a computer was a place to play, experiment, and learn.
          I call it the C-prompt lifestyle. That curiosity still has somewhere to go.
        </p>
        <p>
          You don't need to have grown up with those machines to join in.
          Bring the work you know, the questions you have, and something you'd like to try.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your craft, your people, your next meaningful thing. That's where we start.
        </p>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
          For more of what I make and learn along the way, check out the games,
          albums, Substack series, and other strange artifacts at my personal site!
        </p>
        <a href="https://charleswilke.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost">charleswilke.com</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-sidebar">

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <div class="label">// works with</div>
          <ul class="sidebar-list">
            <li>Curious individuals</li>
            <li>People learning AI in their roles</li>
            <li>Teams building skills together</li>
            <li>Associations & communities</li>
            <li>Conference organizers</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <div class="label">// disciplines</div>
          <ul class="sidebar-list">
            <li>One-to-one AI tutoring</li>
            <li>Role-focused learning</li>
            <li>AI-assisted workflow design</li>
            <li>Custom tool development</li>
            <li>Workshops & speaking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <div class="label">// contact</div>
          <a href="/book" class="sidebar-link">Book a call →</a>
          <a href="mailto:cwilke@fellowvector.com" class="sidebar-link">Send an email →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <div class="label">// fellow vector is</div>
          <p class="sidebar-note">
            Just Charles. Your tutor and fellow learner.<br />You work with me directly, with room to ask questions and try things out.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <div class="label">// recently on exploring l.ai.bor</div>
          <SubstackFeed limit={3} />
          <a href="/writing" class="sidebar-link" style="margin-top: var(--sp-xs);">Explore more →</a>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-surname {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Each outline uses Besley's advance width and sits on the text baseline. */
  .about-name :global(.name-letter) {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: baseline;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgb(255 189 89 / 0.5)) drop-shadow(0 0 9px rgb(255 189 89 / 0.15));
  }

  .about-name :global(.name-r) {
    width: 0.5335em;
    height: 0.533em;
    margin-inline-end: -0.04em;
  }

  .about-name :global(.name-w) {
    width: 1.252em;
    height: 0.8595em;
    margin-inline-end: -0.06em;
    vertical-align: -0.01em;
  }

  .about-name :global(.name-l) {
    width: 0.349em;
    height: 0.851em;
  }

  .about-name :global(.name-i) {
    width: 0.3625em;
    height: 0.7705em;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .about-name :global(.name-i-dot) {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgb(255 189 89 / 0.12));
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .about-name :global(.name-i-dot) {
      animation: about-dot-glow 4.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  }

  @keyframes about-dot-glow {
    50% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgb(255 189 89 / 0.45)); }
  }

  .page-hero-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* ── Portrait ── */
  .portrait-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .portrait-glitch-container {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border: 1px solid var(--phosphor-dim);
  }

  .portrait-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Real photo underneath, always visible */
  .portrait-reveal {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Glitch slices: horizontal bands that reveal the photo */
  .glitch-slice {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    z-index: 2;
    background-image: var(--cw2-bg);
    background-size: 100% auto;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: normal;
  }

  .glitch-slice.s1 {
    top: 15%;
    height: 12%;
    background-position: 0 15%;
  }
  .glitch-slice.s2 {
    top: 45%;
    height: 8%;
    background-position: 0 45%;
  }
  .glitch-slice.s3 {
    top: 72%;
    height: 15%;
    background-position: 0 72%;
  }

  /* Glitch runs by default, cursor pointer for click-to-flip */
  .portrait-glitch-container {
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .portrait-img {
    animation: glitch-flicker 12s steps(2) infinite;
  }

  .portrait-reveal {
    animation: reveal-flash 18s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  .glitch-slice.s1 {
    animation: slice-glitch-1 16s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  .glitch-slice.s2 {
    animation: slice-glitch-2 20s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  .glitch-slice.s3 {
    animation: slice-glitch-3 14s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  /* Hover: horizontal band that follows cursor — stepped/pixelated edges */
  .portrait-glitch-container:hover .portrait-img {
    --band-center: var(--my, 50%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      black 0%,
      black calc(var(--band-center) - 28%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) - 28%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) - 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) - 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) - 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) - 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) - 16%),
      transparent calc(var(--band-center) - 16%),
      transparent calc(var(--band-center) + 16%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) + 16%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) + 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) + 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) + 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) + 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) + 28%),
      black calc(var(--band-center) + 28%),
      black 100%
    );
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      black 0%,
      black calc(var(--band-center) - 28%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) - 28%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) - 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) - 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) - 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) - 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) - 16%),
      transparent calc(var(--band-center) - 16%),
      transparent calc(var(--band-center) + 16%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) + 16%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.3) calc(var(--band-center) + 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) + 20%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.6) calc(var(--band-center) + 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) + 24%),
      rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(var(--band-center) + 28%),
      black calc(var(--band-center) + 28%),
      black 100%
    );
  }
  .portrait-glitch-container:hover .portrait-reveal {
    animation: none;
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .portrait-glitch-container:hover .glitch-slice {
    animation: none;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* Flip animation on the container */
  .portrait-glitch-container {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .portrait-wrap.flipping .portrait-glitch-container {
    transform: scaleX(0);
  }

  /* Flipped state: show real photo, hide drawn */
  .portrait-wrap.flipped .portrait-img {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: none;
    -webkit-mask-image: none;
    mask-image: none;
  }
  .portrait-wrap.flipped .portrait-reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    animation: none;
  }
  .portrait-wrap.flipped .glitch-slice {
    animation: none;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* Flipped hover: just show the photo clean */
  .portrait-wrap.flipped .portrait-glitch-container:hover .portrait-img {
    opacity: 0;
    -webkit-mask-image: none;
    mask-image: none;
  }
  .portrait-wrap.flipped .portrait-glitch-container:hover .portrait-reveal {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @keyframes glitch-flicker {
    0%   { opacity: 1; }
    94%  { opacity: 1; }
    94.5%{ opacity: 0.7; transform: translateX(2px); }
    95.5%{ opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
    97%  { opacity: 1; }
    97.5%{ opacity: 0.85; transform: translateX(-1px); }
    98%  { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  @keyframes reveal-flash {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    92%  { opacity: 0; }
    92.5%{ opacity: 1; }
    94%  { opacity: 1; }
    94.5%{ opacity: 0; }
  }

  @keyframes slice-glitch-1 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(0); }
    93%  { opacity: 0; }
    93.5%{ opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-4px); }
    94.5%{ opacity: 1; transform: translateX(6px); }
    95%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  @keyframes slice-glitch-2 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(0); }
    91%  { opacity: 0; }
    91.5%{ opacity: 1; transform: translateX(8px); }
    92.5%{ opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-3px); }
    93%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  @keyframes slice-glitch-3 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(0); }
    95%  { opacity: 0; }
    95.5%{ opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-6px); }
    96.5%{ opacity: 0; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  .portrait-scanlines {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at center,
      transparent 35%,
      rgba(16, 13, 9, 0.7) 75%,
      rgba(16, 13, 9, 0.92) 100%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .portrait-cta {
    --btn-inline-space: 0.5rem;
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--sp-sm);
    padding-block: 0.65rem;
    padding-inline-start: calc(var(--btn-inline-space) + 1.25em);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* Default (cw4 cream): dark wedges in the photo corners */
  .portrait-wrap .corner.tl { border-top-color: #100d09; border-left-color: #100d09; }
  .portrait-wrap .corner.tr { border-top-color: #100d09; border-right-color: #100d09; }
  .portrait-wrap .corner.bl { border-bottom-color: #100d09; border-left-color: #100d09; }
  .portrait-wrap .corner.br { border-bottom-color: #100d09; border-right-color: #100d09; }

  /* When cw2 is revealed, wedges go back to phosphor */
  .portrait-glitch-container:hover .corner,
  .portrait-wrap.flipped .corner {
    border-color: var(--phosphor) !important;
  }

  .corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .corner.tl { top: 7px;    left: 7px;   border-top:    1px solid var(--phosphor); border-left:   1px solid var(--phosphor); }
  .corner.tr { top: 7px;    right: 7px;  border-top:    1px solid var(--phosphor); border-right:  1px solid var(--phosphor); }
  .corner.bl { bottom: 7px;  left: 7px;  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--phosphor); border-left:   1px solid var(--phosphor); }
  .corner.br { bottom: 7px;  right: 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--phosphor); border-right:  1px solid var(--phosphor); }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 260px;
    gap: var(--layout-gap);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: block;
  }

  .about-body > p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-md);
  }

  .about-body::after {
    content: '';
    display: table;
    clear: both;
  }

  .portrait-inline {
    float: right;
    width: 240px;
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-md) var(--sp-lg);
    shape-outside: inset(0);
  }

  .about-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-lg);
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 16px);
  }

  .sidebar-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-sm);
  }

  .sidebar-list {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .sidebar-list li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    padding-block: calc(var(--sp-xs) / 2);
    padding-left: var(--sp-sm);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .sidebar-list li {
      position: relative;
    }

    .sidebar-list li::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0 auto 0 -1px;
      width: 1px;
      background: var(--phosphor);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-phosphor);
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 180ms ease;
    }

    .sidebar-list li:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .sidebar-note {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .sidebar-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--phosphor);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 959px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-lg);
    }

    .about-sidebar {
      position: static;
    }

  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .portrait-inline {
      width: min(42%, 196px);
      margin: 0 0 var(--sp-sm) var(--sp-sm);
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  let flipping = false;

  document.querySelectorAll('.portrait-glitch-container').forEach((container) => {
    // Click to flip with animation
    container.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (flipping) return;
      flipping = true;

      const wraps = document.querySelectorAll('.portrait-wrap');
      const willFlip = !wraps[0].classList.contains('flipped');

      // Phase 1: collapse
      wraps.forEach((w) => w.classList.add('flipping'));

      setTimeout(() => {
        // Phase 2: swap at midpoint
        wraps.forEach((w) => w.classList.toggle('flipped', willFlip));

        // Phase 3: expand
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          wraps.forEach((w) => w.classList.remove('flipping'));
          setTimeout(() => { flipping = false; }, 300);
        });
      }, 300);
    });

    // Track mouse for band mask
    container.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
      const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();
      const x = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 100).toFixed(1) + '%';
      const y = ((e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height * 100).toFixed(1) + '%';
      const wrap = container.closest('.portrait-wrap');
      if (wrap) {
        wrap.style.setProperty('--mx', x);
        wrap.style.setProperty('--my', y);
      }
    });
  });
</script>
